    "theorem": "JVLocalMultiplicityAudit.jv_local_multiplicity_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem jv_local_multiplicity_certificate : Module.length A A = 8 ∧ IsLocalRing A ∧ originIdeal.IsMaximal ∧ Nonempty (A ⧸ originIdeal ≃+* F) ∧ (∀ p : PrimeSpectrum A, p = originPoint) ∧ IsOpen ({originPoint} : Set (PrimeSpectrum A)) ∧ Nat.card (PrimeSpectrum A) = 1 ∧ Function.Bijective (algebraMap A OriginLocalization) ∧ Module.length OriginLocalization OriginLocalization = 8 ∧ IsLocalRing OriginLocalization ∧ Nonempty (ActualLocalizedResidue ≃+* F) ∧ h ^ 3 ≠ 0 ∧ h ^ 4 = 0 ∧ ¬ IsReduced A ∧ Subsingleton FirstChart ∧ Module.length FirstChart FirstChart = 0 ∧ ¬ IsLocalRing FirstChart ∧ Subsingleton FirstOpen ∧ Module.length FirstOpen FirstOpen = 0 ∧ ¬ IsLocalRing FirstOpen ∧ secondF0 (69 : F) 75 1 = 0 ∧ secondF1 (69 : F) 75 1 = 0 ∧ secondF2 (69 : F) 75 1 = 0 ∧ Nontrivial SecondChart ∧ Nontrivial SecondOpen ∧ Module.length A A ≠ Nat.card (ConeSolutions F) ∧ ∀ (L : Type) [Field L] [CharP L 101], Nat.card (ConeSolutions L) = 1",
    "decl_sha256": "59b1c8ec79f8518956b08bef41ee9fa233ab2de63bae53f7dc0e2fc356dcf850",
    "scope": "Literal first Joux–Vitse homogeneous F101 source ideal and actual quotient A. Actual self-module length8, derived locality, maximal origin kernel and quotient residue F101; actual unique isolated prime. Actual canonical Localization.AtPrime(originIdeal) coefficient map bijective, actual own self-module length8/locality and canonical residue field isomorphic F101. Actual h³neq0/h⁴zero/nonreducedness. Actual h=1 quotient and principal-open localization at h subsingleton/selflength0/notlocal. Source second literal triple has actual F101 root(69,75,1); actual h=1 quotient and principal-open evaluation homomorphisms to F101 prove nontriviality, with no uniqueness/wholecurve/order/scalar/decomposition claim. Actual cone pointcard1 over every characteristic101 field is an explicitly credited cardinality corollary of prior all-field zero characterization; actual ring length differs. No supplied locality/length/isolation/residue/evaluation correctness premise. Six new modules,18frozen local dependency modules/0copies;33old formal/configuration pins and61old formal/artifactpins checked before/after every numbered build. Classical actual ideal-tail flag adapted from credited prior power-basis length argument, without assuming actual JV is monogenic. Ordinary homogeneous affine cone is not Diem product(P1)^n multihomogeneous setup; qualified n!d^n with multiplicities is unrefuted. Scheme.Spec/localRing/cycle comparison, general multihomogeneous intersection/isolated components/positive-dimensional/projective cycles and Rojas C refinement remainopen. Historical native GB sizes6/1/2 do not directly certify multiplicity8; no new solver/native experiment. Defaultlimits/standardfoundations/noholes/customaxioms/nativeproofeval/flags/waivers/frozenedits/cryptoPython/spend/upload. No novelty/physicalhost/compiler/backend/runtime/signedstanding/canonicalpromotion/full14 claim.",
